# Generated by forge from python/fastapi/deprecated-params (mode: forbid).
id: python/fastapi/deprecated-params
language: Python
severity: error
message: forge:python/fastapi/deprecated-params No FastAPI parameters deprecated only at run time. Query/Path/Header/Cookie/Body/Form/File take pattern= (not regex=) and examples= or openapi_examples= (not example=); FastAPI() takes no root_path= (pass --root-path to fastapi run or uvicorn).
rule:
