id: python/fastapi/testclient-lifespan
language: Python
severity: warning
message: "forge:python/fastapi/testclient-lifespan Advice: TestClient(app) is entered as a context manager (with TestClient(app) as client:, a fixture yielding inside the with): otherwise the app's lifespan never runs, and startup work such as opening the database pool is skipped."
