id: python/pydantic/typeadapter-module-level
language: Python
severity: warning
message: "forge:python/pydantic/typeadapter-module-level Advice: a TypeAdapter is built once, at module level or in a cached function (@cache, @lru_cache, @cached_property), not in a function body: each construction builds the validator and serializer again."
